      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c1a5c89f6cea65b3b6452fa|full_name}: \nYeah. But with the previous update, avatar elements are now counted more accurately, and uploads are now limited by the number of polygons, not material or Shader. (The limit has been removed after a few hours of posting)\nIf the development team continued to limit uploads by polygon count, I would like to suggest removing the limits and dividing them into ranks that are blocked by default. Now that the upload restrictions have been removed (thanks to staffs) and uploading is possible, this proposal is already over.",
      "viewerReactions": null
